{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03205","headline":"和辅先入昊天观星瞻 · 杨炯","name":"和辅先入昊天观星瞻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遁甲爰皇里，星占太乙宫。\n天门开奕奕，佳气郁葱葱。\n碧落三乾外，黄图四海中。\n邑居环若水，城阙抵新丰。\n玉槛崑仑侧，金枢地轴东。\n上真朝北斗，元始咏南风。\n汉君祠五帝，淮王礼八公。\n道书编竹简，灵液灌梧桐。\n草茂琼阶绿，花繁宝树红。\n石楼纷似画，地镜淼如空。\n桑海年应积，桃源路不穷。\n黄轩若有问，三月住崆峒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03205.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03205","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}